     "body": "<p>I've uploaded everything in trunk/resources/wsdl/ and trunk/fcrepo-server/src/main/resources/xsd.  I think this covers it all, but still need to verify that the updates Asger put in place for \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-737\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-737\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Fedora xsd schemas are wrong\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-737\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (inside the objects now) are also reflected in these files..</p>",
